WEBVTT


00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.621
Only the strategy map is missing.


00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:56.819
We must track him down at once.


00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:00.490
The bodies of the brothers shall be
taken by rearguard units.


00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.121
Yes, commander.


00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:27.886
This is it.


00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:34.685
Insufferable savages!


00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:47.840
Young Master!


00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:49.967
Is that Miss Ja-in?


00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.399
Master!


00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:57.075
Wait till sunset.


00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.979
What difference will it make?


00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:04.452
Can'tjust go without a plan.


00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:08.387
Look at their numbers.


00:02:08.728 --> 00:02:11.526
We'll take the leader as hostage
and exchange him for Ja-in.


00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:13.700
That's the only way.


00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:14.801
Is it going to work?


00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:17.065
What about an exit strategy?


00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:21.307
After we get Ja-in,


00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:23.610
we'll cross the river and
meet back at this hut.


00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.771
By tommorrow noon.


00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:28.705
- Okay.
- But, Nam-yi,


00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:32.142
we have no plans on
how we'll catch their leader.


00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:33.985
- Gang-du!
- Yeah?


00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:35.884
There is something I want you to do.


00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:36.953
What is it?


00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:50.132
How insipid!
This is no fun.


00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.870
Your men have no backbones
and women have no fidelity.


00:02:58.878 --> 00:02:59.936
I'm curious.


00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:02.180
What broke you down so quickly?


00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:05.449
Was it thirst or hunger?


00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:07.752
Or despair?


00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:11.190
My father the Khan once told me,


00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:14.557
men and animals alike,
the best way to them is food.


00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:17.392
Looking at you,
I see he was right.


00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:20.166
My father once told me,


00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:22.259
one's vision is clouded
when one is hungry.


00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:25.801
So, one must always fill
the stomach before a fight.


00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.002
Are you saying you're a warrior?


00:03:31.578 --> 00:03:33.603
I'm a warrior's daughter.


00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.773
I shall not beg for life,


00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:38.543
nor shall I die in vain.


00:03:48.294 --> 00:03:49.261
Damn!


00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:50.563
Lmpudent bitch!


00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:52.588
Yeah, that's more like it.


00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:09.048
Go on, try again.


00:04:09.048 --> 00:04:10.948
Don't give up.


00:04:16.089 --> 00:04:16.885
What's going on?


00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:19.389
The prisoners are getting away.


00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:24.154
Your Highness!


00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:26.833
Do not interfere.


00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:28.596
Anyone who disobeys
shall be killed.


00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.133
- Leave us.
- But, Your Highness...


00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:38.604
This way! Come on.


00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:40.810
Follow them.


00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:48.244
Who the hell are you?


00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:50.957
Long live, Manchu!


00:04:50.957 --> 00:04:52.322
- Manchu?
- Manchu.


00:04:52.725 --> 00:04:54.352
Yes, Manchu.


00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:55.919
Tza-it! Tza-it!


00:04:56.062 --> 00:04:56.858
What?


00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.690
I see now


00:05:03.236 --> 00:05:06.103
how stubborn and stupid
Joseon's women are.


00:05:17.016 --> 00:05:19.814
That skewer is all you depend on.


00:05:31.364 --> 00:05:32.626
The strategy worked.


00:05:33.066 --> 00:05:36.502
Let's get out of here.


00:05:36.602 --> 00:05:38.304
Can you take it from here?


00:05:38.304 --> 00:05:39.100
But, Master...


00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:40.061
Master!


00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.269
- Master!
- Master!


00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:43.843
It's them.
Get those two first.


00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:44.810
Let's go.


00:05:55.121 --> 00:05:56.418
Who the hell are you?


00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:12.294
Are you hurt?


00:06:13.506 --> 00:06:14.598
Nam-yi!


00:06:16.209 --> 00:06:18.336
I'm sorry I took so long.


00:06:32.024 --> 00:06:33.321
Release the Prince.


00:06:34.427 --> 00:06:36.156
Or, I'll kill her.


00:06:45.938 --> 00:06:46.870
Madam!


00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:52.742
Who are you people?


00:07:00.219 --> 00:07:01.117
What are you doing?


00:07:04.957 --> 00:07:05.753
Damn you!


00:07:06.058 --> 00:07:07.082
Damn you!


00:07:20.239 --> 00:07:21.570
- Your Highness!
- No!


00:07:22.175 --> 00:07:23.335
Step back.


00:07:24.043 --> 00:07:24.805
Nobody move.


00:07:24.944 --> 00:07:26.502
Shoot him.


00:07:29.081 --> 00:07:30.013
Hold your bows.


00:07:30.216 --> 00:07:32.207
- Go now.
- What about you?


00:07:33.553 --> 00:07:34.918
Remember what I said?


00:07:35.254 --> 00:07:37.984
I'll meet you at the hut
tomorrow noon.


00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:39.318
We'll be waiting.


00:07:40.326 --> 00:07:42.954
No! You're coming with us.


00:07:43.196 --> 00:07:44.857
You want us to die here?


00:07:47.867 --> 00:07:51.462
We leave together
or we die here together.


00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:53.567
Don't tell me to
leave you like this.


00:07:59.679 --> 00:08:03.615
Madam, we cannot
all go together.


00:08:03.716 --> 00:08:06.583
Wait for me.
I promise I'll see you again.


00:08:22.668 --> 00:08:26.126
You hope to live
after what you have done?


00:08:28.274 --> 00:08:31.471
I woudn't have done it
if I cared to live.


00:08:52.131 --> 00:08:55.498
Are you afraid
now that you'r time is up?


00:08:56.869 --> 00:09:01.499
The firewood has
almost burned out.


00:09:10.049 --> 00:09:11.038
Thank you


00:09:12.118 --> 00:09:13.050
for holding up so long.


00:10:20.353 --> 00:10:21.718
Where is His Highness?


00:10:29.962 --> 00:10:32.021
He was assassinated.


00:10:43.342 --> 00:10:44.400
Please.


00:10:52.718 --> 00:10:54.481
Commander, he went in that direction.


00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.520
Our men went after him.


00:11:30.289 --> 00:11:31.881
- Nam-yi!
- Nam-yi!


00:11:32.992 --> 00:11:34.425
It's great to see you again.


00:11:38.431 --> 00:11:39.625
You made it.


00:11:40.733 --> 00:11:43.463
What about Miss Ja-in?
And, the young Master?


00:11:43.569 --> 00:11:45.230
They should be ahead of us.


00:11:45.538 --> 00:11:46.972
How fortunate!


00:11:46.972 --> 00:11:49.099
We must try to catch up.


00:11:49.608 --> 00:11:52.545
They must be going after them, too.


00:11:52.545 --> 00:11:53.534
Gang-du, over there.


00:12:07.893 --> 00:12:09.588
What the hell?


00:12:10.196 --> 00:12:12.960
Now it's reds instead of the blues?


00:12:19.405 --> 00:12:20.463
It's the heavy pounder.


00:12:20.573 --> 00:12:22.063
What?


00:12:22.174 --> 00:12:24.039
The arrowhead alone weighs
over one hundred pounds.


00:12:24.176 --> 00:12:25.939
It's more powerful than
mechanical crossbows.


00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.141
We must go into the woods.


00:12:44.029 --> 00:12:45.360
Get into siege formation.


00:13:36.849 --> 00:13:38.684
That doesn't look right.
Let's go this way.


00:13:38.684 --> 00:13:39.742
We must cut through here.


00:13:39.852 --> 00:13:41.820
Come on, we move on.


00:13:41.954 --> 00:13:43.945
Nam-yi, I think he's right.


00:13:44.123 --> 00:13:45.283
- Let's go.
- Come on.


00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.360
The path ends there.
We got them.


00:13:53.465 --> 00:13:56.161
We must capture him alive.
He shall suffer to his last breath.


00:14:07.446 --> 00:14:08.344
Come on, hurry.


00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:11.780
Gang-du!


00:14:23.929 --> 00:14:24.953
Look out!


00:14:29.368 --> 00:14:30.995
We must hurry.


00:14:34.006 --> 00:14:34.836
Gang-du!


00:14:36.108 --> 00:14:37.405
- Gang-du!
- Gang-du!


00:14:38.043 --> 00:14:39.032
Gang-du!


00:14:39.378 --> 00:14:42.142
It's a miracle I got this far.
Leave me.


00:14:42.348 --> 00:14:43.315
Gang-du.


00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.210
Gang-du!


00:14:49.355 --> 00:14:51.190
Go!
I'll hold them off as long as I can.


00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:52.122
Gang-du!


00:14:52.291 --> 00:14:53.225
Go on.


00:14:53.225 --> 00:14:55.489
Gang-du, no!


00:14:55.728 --> 00:14:56.629
Get going.


00:14:56.629 --> 00:14:57.926
Gang-du.


00:15:11.443 --> 00:15:13.212
Cut the net!


00:15:13.212 --> 00:15:15.305
I can't move.


00:15:21.854 --> 00:15:22.786
Help them.


00:15:33.132 --> 00:15:35.726
The marking for tiger traps,


00:15:38.837 --> 00:15:40.702
it's the same here.


00:16:21.013 --> 00:16:23.982
I can't go any further.
I'm too old for this.


00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.508
Gab-yong!


00:16:30.823 --> 00:16:31.590
Gab-yong!


00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:32.579
Go on.


00:16:33.158 --> 00:16:37.322
Take care of Miss Ja-in
and the Master.


00:17:18.537 --> 00:17:21.700
I'm taking one of you with me.


00:18:05.651 --> 00:18:06.447
Shoot.


00:18:19.097 --> 00:18:20.587
It's him.


00:18:20.699 --> 00:18:22.963
He is still alive.


00:18:29.908 --> 00:18:30.875
We'll cross.


00:18:35.881 --> 00:18:36.779
Adai!


00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.254
Naigada!


00:19:50.088 --> 00:19:51.055
Let's cross, hurry!


00:20:12.144 --> 00:20:13.145
Adai!


00:20:13.145 --> 00:20:14.134
Come on.


00:20:27.726 --> 00:20:28.852
Adai!


00:20:46.545 --> 00:20:47.739
Wanhan!


00:20:49.548 --> 00:20:50.537
Hurry.


00:20:52.217 --> 00:20:53.184
Let me go.


00:20:53.619 --> 00:20:55.086
Get him for me.


00:20:55.887 --> 00:20:57.320
Don't give up.


00:21:14.106 --> 00:21:15.266
Commander!


00:21:45.537 --> 00:21:47.835
We're falling behind.
We must pick up speed.


00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:00.215
- I'll do it.
- Let me...


00:22:15.133 --> 00:22:16.623
You have blisters.


00:22:23.041 --> 00:22:27.944
They say if you cross back
to Joseon, you'll be punished.


00:22:29.481 --> 00:22:33.417
They won't do that to
their fellow countrymen.


00:22:34.953 --> 00:22:37.080
It's probably to stop
people from crossing over.


00:22:40.192 --> 00:22:41.625
My husband.


00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:47.893
I'll hang on to that.


00:23:02.147 --> 00:23:04.240
I'll get some drinking water.


00:23:43.388 --> 00:23:44.719
Get back inside.


00:23:57.335 --> 00:23:58.324
Madam!


00:24:00.071 --> 00:24:00.901
My eye!


00:24:17.989 --> 00:24:18.853
Madam!


00:25:45.343 --> 00:25:46.401
Chase him.


00:26:28.086 --> 00:26:28.984
I got you.


00:26:29.688 --> 00:26:30.712
Keep chasing.


00:27:29.414 --> 00:27:30.381
He turned back.


00:28:50.995 --> 00:28:52.428
Let me ask you a question.


00:28:52.997 --> 00:28:57.229
Why didn't you shoot me
at the cliff?


00:29:01.106 --> 00:29:05.065
Was it to bring me into contempt?


00:29:08.246 --> 00:29:13.115
He shall suffer to his last breath.
Cut off his


00:29:33.905 --> 00:29:34.701
Look out.


00:30:50.081 --> 00:30:51.173
Which way?


00:30:52.283 --> 00:30:53.409
I'm not sure.


00:30:53.818 --> 00:30:57.219
But, there is only one way.


00:30:57.889 --> 00:30:59.880
Just one way?


00:31:00.558 --> 00:31:03.186
The river border is close.
We'll catch up.


00:31:11.836 --> 00:31:12.768
Hurahu!


00:31:20.011 --> 00:31:21.171
Come to your senses.


00:31:23.915 --> 00:31:26.247
I feel something
ominous in the air.


00:31:30.688 --> 00:31:32.178
Are you not a son of Manchuria?


00:31:34.058 --> 00:31:37.789
Hurahu shall take the lead.


00:33:18.162 --> 00:33:18.958
One.


00:33:27.205 --> 00:33:28.229
Two.


00:33:42.620 --> 00:33:43.587
Three.


00:34:03.875 --> 00:34:04.807
Four.


00:35:02.266 --> 00:35:03.290
It's the short arrow.


00:35:04.936 --> 00:35:09.270
The same sniper arrows
we saw at the battle of fortress?


00:35:09.707 --> 00:35:12.175
But, it has a jagged tip.


00:35:13.044 --> 00:35:14.412
There is no arrow head.


00:35:14.412 --> 00:35:16.573
He made it from a regular arrow.


00:35:18.416 --> 00:35:21.146
It makes no difference for us.


00:35:32.396 --> 00:35:34.261
My brother!


00:35:35.166 --> 00:35:36.326
Hurahu!


00:35:41.739 --> 00:35:42.933
Don't come to me.


00:35:44.475 --> 00:35:45.499
Stop!


00:39:19.156 --> 00:39:20.123
Ja-in!


00:40:36.834 --> 00:40:37.698
Ja-in!


00:40:42.106 --> 00:40:43.403
Nam-yi!


00:41:43.934 --> 00:41:44.798
Ja-in!


00:43:09.286 --> 00:43:12.585
All this trouble,


00:43:12.723 --> 00:43:14.190
to save her?


00:43:31.642 --> 00:43:32.973
Are you calculating the wind?


00:43:36.146 --> 00:43:38.171
But, I already saw your arrow.


00:43:38.615 --> 00:43:40.879
There is no point in
calculating the wind.


00:44:12.549 --> 00:44:14.176
Did you fear for your girl?


00:44:16.520 --> 00:44:18.249
You may know how to
shoot curved projectiles.


00:44:20.057 --> 00:44:24.687
But it's your fear that got
you and I killed.


00:44:25.729 --> 00:44:28.220
Now, it's your turn to
feel the pain of


00:44:29.700 --> 00:44:33.363
watching your loved one die.


00:44:38.442 --> 00:44:39.739
No, Nam-yi!


00:44:40.511 --> 00:44:42.672
Don't pull that arrow!
You'll die!


00:44:50.721 --> 00:44:51.881
You lost.


00:44:54.892 --> 00:44:57.156
No, Nam-yi!


00:45:13.477 --> 00:45:15.911
Now you'll sacrifice her?


00:45:34.798 --> 00:45:37.790
Even the wind isn't on your side.


00:46:16.340 --> 00:46:20.071
The fear, you simply
face it straight on.


00:46:26.450 --> 00:46:32.355
The wind, is not to be calculated,
but to be overcome.


00:46:39.296 --> 00:46:42.925
Who... are you?


00:47:06.723 --> 00:47:08.122
Nam-yi.


00:47:21.038 --> 00:47:24.201
Here! The other one!


00:47:25.442 --> 00:47:26.636
You knew they were from me.


00:47:27.244 --> 00:47:30.270
Of course I did.
They were so big.


00:47:31.848 --> 00:47:34.749
Only you can get it so wrong.


00:47:36.320 --> 00:47:38.754
They were too big for you?


00:47:40.524 --> 00:47:44.790
I thought you had all grown up.
Maybe not so much.


00:47:49.299 --> 00:47:50.266
Ja-in.


00:47:52.703 --> 00:47:53.567
Ja-in.


00:47:55.872 --> 00:47:57.499
Let's go back to our home in Seoul.


00:47:59.543 --> 00:48:00.942
We'll go home.


00:48:02.346 --> 00:48:06.373
Then... wear pretty silk shoes.


00:49:00.937 --> 00:49:01.904
Look.


00:49:11.081 --> 00:49:14.175
It's our land that
we must go back to.


00:49:40.210 --> 00:49:45.082
<i>Following the invasion, there was
no repatriation effort on Joseon's part.</i>


00:49:45.082 --> 00:49:49.746
<i>Only a handful of people
found their way back on their own.</i>


00:50:09.573 --> 00:50:14.909
Tiger! Oh, tiger!
Good tiger of Mt. Songak,


00:50:15.178 --> 00:50:20.206
Bring me a bride
for this piece of cake.


00:50:22.152 --> 00:50:28.614
Where is she now?
Where is my dear one?


00:50:29.793 --> 00:50:34.526
Where is my dear one?
My darling as soft as feathers.


00:50:34.631 --> 00:50:41.195
Tiger! Oh, tiger!
Good tiger of Mt. Songak,


00:50:41.471 --> 00:50:46.135
Bring me a bride
for this piece of cake.

